speechtext:
In so far as
the Prime Minister's and Privy Council Offices are concerned: 1. April 25, 1974-Ottawa to Hamilton, MOT Viscount: The Prime Minister; Hon. John Munro; Bob Murdoch, PMO; Colin Kenny, PMO; Peter McGuire, PMO; A1 Donnelly, PMO; Dal Warrington, Press; Fred Chartrand, Press; B. Stewart, Press; Don Dixon, Press; Rudi Wolf, Press; D. Beauchamp, Press; Mike Lavoie, Press; Jim Ferra-bee, Press; Claude Henault, Press; Jack Derouin, Press; Geoff Stevens, Press; Jean-Marc Poliquin, Press; Frangois Rouleau, Press. April 25, 1974- Hamilton to Toronto, DND Helicopter? A. The Prime Minister; Insp. Russ Harding, RCMP; Colin Kenny, PMO; Bob Murdoch, PMO; Dal Warrington, Press. B. A1 Donnelly, PMO; Cpl. Jack Prout, OPP; Dave Isaac, Press; Hal Jones, Press; Jack Derouin, Press; Jean-Marc	Poliquin,	Press;	Frangois	Rouleau,	Press;Claude Henault, Press; Fred Chartrand, Press. C. Peter McGuire, PMO; Sgt. T. Lafontaine, RCMP; B. Stewart, Press; Don Dixon, Press; Rudi Wolf, Press; D. Beauchamp, Press; Mike Lavoie, Press; Geoff Stevens, Press; Jim Ferra-bee, Press. April 26, 1974-Toronto to Woodstock, DND Helicopter: A. The Prime Minister; Hon. Gene Whelan; Insp. Russ Harding, RCMP; Colin Kenny, PMO; Dal Warrington, Press. B. A1 Donnelly, PMO; Cpl. Jack Prout, OPP; Dave Isaac, Press; Hal Jones, Press; Jack Derouin, Press; Jean-Marc	Poliquin,	Press;	Frangois	Rouleau,	Press;
Claude Henault, Press; Fred Chartand, Press; Bob Murdoch, PMO. C. Peter McGuire, PMO; Sgt. T. Lafontaine, RCMP; B. Stewart, Press; Don Dixon, Press; Rudi Wold, Press; D. Beauchamp, Press; Mike Lavoie, Press; Geoff Stevens, Press; Jim Ferrabee, Press. April 26, 1974-Wood-stock to Sarnia, DND Helicopter: A. The Prime Minister; Insp. Russ Harding, RCMP; Colin Kenny, PMO; Bob Murdoch, PMO; Dal Warrington, Press. B. A1 Donnelly, PMO; Cpl. Jack Prout, OPP; Dave Isaac, Press; Hal Jones, Press; Jack Derouin, Press; Jean-Marc Poliquin, Press; Frangois Rouleau, Press; Claude Henault, Press; Fred Chartand, Press. C. Peter McGuire, PMO; Sgt. T. Lafontaine, RCMP; B. Stewart, Press; Don Dixon, Press; Rudi Wolf, Press; D. Beauchamp, Press; Mike Lavoie, Press; Geoff Stevens, Press; Jim Ferrabee, Press. April 26, 1974-Sarnia to Sudbury, MOT Viscount: The Prime Minister; Bob Murdoch, PMO; Colin Kenny, PMO; Peter McGuire, PMO; A1 Donnelly, PMO; Fred Chartrand, Press; B. Stewart, Press; Don Dixon, Press; Rudi Wolf, Press; D. Beauchamp, Press; Hal Jones, Press; Mike Lavoie, Press; Jim Ferrabee, Press; Claude Henault, Press; Geoff Stevens, Press; Jean-Marc Poliquin, Press; Frangois Rouleau, Press. April 26, 1974- Sudbury to Ottawa, MOT Viscount: The Prime Minister;

